title: Internal Security
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: police_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: ddp_in_government = 1 and interior_minister_party = "DDP" and police_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/HugoPreuss.jpg

= Internal Security

Our young Democracy is threatened from all sides by it's enemies, as well as having a plethora of other internal issues regarding bureaucracy and administration.

Hugo Preuss, from our party, is the current Interior minister, and with his help we can start addressing these problems, one at a time.

- @police_creation
- @bolster_police
- @republicanise
- @investigate_corruption
- @investigate_far_right
- @fund_republikanische_soldatenwehr
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@police_creation
title: Create the interior police.
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget > 0 and interior_police_formed == 0
on-arrival: budget -= 1; interior_police_formed += 1; interior_police_loyalty += 0.02
unavailable-subtitle: [? if budget <= 0 : Requires 1 budget. ?] [? if interior_police_formed == 0 : The interior police has already been formed. ?]

We have approved the creation of the Sicherheitspolizei, a police force in charge of protecting the Republic and investigating it's enemies. However, we still must expand it to increase its effectiveness.

@bolster_police
title: Increase the Sicherheitspolizei's strength.
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget > 0 and interior_police_formed = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if interior_police_formed = 0 : We must create a police force first. ?][? if budget <= 0 : Requires 1 budget. ?]
on-arrival: budget -= 1; interior_police_strength += 15; interior_police_loyalty += 0.02

We have increased the Sicherheitspolizei's budget, creating new branches and improving police training. This strenghtens the police and improves their loyalty to the goverment.

Current interior police loyalty: [+ interior_police_loyalty : loyalty +]

@republicanise
title: Republicanize the Bureaucracy by purging reactionary and imperial officials.
choose-if: bureaucratic_reform < 3
unavailable-subtitle: We have already gone as far as we reasonably can with the current civil service.
on-arrival: bureaucratic_reform += 1; sammlung_strength += 2; dnvp_relation -= 2; economic_growth += 0.1; interior_police_loyalty += 0.02 if interior_police_formed = 1; nationalism -= 5; pacifism += 1; democratization += 1; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_ddp += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; new_middle_ddp += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; coup_progress += 0.5

We have purged a number of old imperial officials, civil servants and bureaucrats with right-wing sympathies, and replaced them with skilled profesionals instead, who are often loyal to our own party.

It costs us goodwill with the DNVP, who see this as a partisan purge dressed up as reform. It does however ensures the bureaucracy's loyalty to the Republic and even slightly improving efficiency.

@investigate_corruption
title: Tackle corruption in the goverment and amongst big businesses.
go-to: investigate_corruption_success if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.5; investigate_corruption_failure if interior_police_loyalty < 0.5

@investigate_corruption_success
on-arrival: investigate_corruption += 1; new_middle_ddp += 4*(1-dissent); budget += 0.2; public_trust += 2; inflation -= 0.1 if inflation > 3

Corruption in big business is rampant, of course. We have uncovered a number of scandals, and publicizing them brings new attention to the work of Interior Minister [+ interior_minister +], building up his popular appeal and that of the DDP.


@investigate_corruption_failure

Unfortunately, our investigations have failed to turn up anything. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by infiltrators within the police.

@investigate_far_right
title: Investigate illegal activity among the far right.
choose-if: interior_police_formed = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if interior_police_formed = 0 : We must create a police force first. ?]
go-to: investigate_far_right_failure if interior_police_loyalty < 0.5; far_right_1 if far_right_investigation = 0 and kapp_putsch_seen = 0; far_right_2 if far_right_investigation = 0 and kapp_putsch_seen = 1; far_right_2 if far_right_investigation = 1 and kapp_putsch_seen = 1; far_right_3 if far_right_investigation = 2; far_right_4 if far_right_investigation = 3; far_right_5 if far_right_investigation = 4 and beer_hall_putsch_seen = 1; far_right_already if far_right_investigation >= 5 or (far_right_investigation = 4 and beer_hall_putsch_seen = 0)

@far_right_1
on-arrival: far_right_investigation = 1; freikorps_underground_risk -= 1 if freikorps_underground_risk > 0; nazi_urgency += 1

We have discovred some plans by far-right Paramilitary veteran groups called Freikorps to overthow the Republic and Democracy in the future. Although these plans aren't concrete yet, it may be useful in the future.

@far_right_2
on-arrival: far_right_investigation = 2; freikorps_underground_risk -= 1 if freikorps_underground_risk > 0; nazi_urgency += 1

We have found evidence that members of the Marinebrigade Ehrhardt Freikorp, the main participant in the Kapp Putsch, have formed a new organization called "Operation Consul", that although we know is extremist and against democracy, we still need to find out further about their intentions.

@far_right_3
on-arrival: far_right_investigation = 3; freikorps_underground_risk -= 3 if freikorps_underground_risk > 0; rathenau_warned += 1; erzberger_warned += 1; dnvp_relation -= 3;

We have raided the headquarters of the "Organization Consul", arresting their leaders and members, while also having found concrete plans to overthrow our Republic, and get rid of the "November Criminals" by assassination and attacks, with the most notable targets being ex-Finance Minister Matthias Erzberger and Member of our party Walther Rathenau, who have been warned about this threat, but for now, it seems they are safe.

@far_right_4
view-if: nsdap_formed = 1
on-arrival: far_right_investigation = 4; sa_strength -= 15 if sa_strength > 0; dnvp_relation -= 4; nsdap_relation -= 3; nazi_urgency += 1

We have investigated several völkisch Parties and groups, among them the "National Socialist German Workers Party" from bavaria, aswell as several sectors of the DNVP, and we have begun disrupting their operations. 

@far_right_5
view-if: beer_hall_putsch_seen = 1
on-arrival: far_right_investigation = 5; nazi_relation -= 5; nsdap_banned = 1 if year < 1925; coup_progress -= 2 if coup_progress > 2; public_trust += 4

We have given the orders to detain the main perpetrators of the "Beer Hall Putsch", chiefly among them Adolf Hitler and Erich Ludendorff* and have begun preparations for their trial.

@far_right_already

Our investigations into far-right subversion continue along the lines already established. There is little new to report at present.

@investigate_far_right_failure

Unfortunately, our investigations have failed to turn up anything. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by infiltrators within the police.

@fund_republikanische_soldatenwehr
title: Inject goverment funds into the Republikanische Soldatenwehr
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget > 0
view-if: kapp_putsch_seen = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if budget <= 0 : Requires 1 budget. ?]
on-arrival: budget -= 1; soldatenwehr_strenghtened_1 += 1; 

We have injected goverment funds into the Soldatenwehr. This is nesceceary if we want it to surive in the long term.




